      "id": "scale-foundation-natural-minor-half-steps",
      "topic": "自然短音階",
      "prompt": "自然短音階では、第II–III音間と第（　）音間が半音で、ほかの隣り合う音の間隔は全音になる。",
      "answer": "V–VI",
      "explanation": "II＝上主音、III＝中音（上中音）、V＝属音、VI＝下中音です。",
      "concept": null,
      "sources": [
        "senzoku-scales",
        "senzoku-degrees",
        "ps-scales"
      ],
      "reviewNotes": [
